{"seq":1,"slug":"exemption-determination-engine-model","title":"计税引擎免税判定模型（税基×产品应税性×资质匹配）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sales-tax-exemption-resale-certificate-management/tax-engine-exemption-determination/exemption-determination-engine-model","wordCount":2845,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"计税引擎免税判定模型-税基-产品应税性-资质匹配\">计税引擎免税判定模型（税基×产品应税性×资质匹配）</h1><p>把免税做成订单级的一个 <code>is_exempt</code> 布尔位，是跨境计税引擎最贵的架构错误。它把三件互相独立、数据来源与变更节奏都不同的事压成了一个开关：这笔交易里<strong>有多少钱属于税基</strong>、这批<strong>货物本身在目的地辖区是否应税</strong>、买方<strong>持有的资质凭证是否恰好覆盖这笔交易</strong>。三者是合取关系——一个持有完整转售证书的买家，在免税州买一条牛仔裤，并不产生&quot;免税&quot;判定，因为产品应税性已判定其为免税品；反过来在纽约买同一批货的经销商，若证书上没勾纽约，前两步都成立，第三步会单独把整笔交易打回应税。三因子模型的价值，是让引擎在任一因子为假时能说出<strong>是哪一个</strong>为假——这是计算正确性的前提，也是审计时唯一的抗辩材料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三轴合取与各自的数据主权\">核心概念：三轴合取与各自的数据主权</h2><p>免税金额可以写成逐行项目的乘积。设行项目税基为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，目的地辖区为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span>，产品税目为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>taxable</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>×</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>2</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{line} = \\text{round}\\big(D \\times \\mathbb{1}[\\text{taxable}(p, j)] \\times \\big(1 - \\mathbb{1}[Q(cert, j, reason)]\\big) \\times r_j,\\ 2\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">taxable</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cer</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是目的地辖区税率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是资质匹配谓词。两个指示函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{1}[\\cdot]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 分别由&quot;产品应税性&quot;和&quot;资质匹配&quot;两条完全独立的规则链路供给。关键在于：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>taxable</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{1}[\\text{taxable}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">taxable</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 的求值<strong>不依赖</strong>任何买方信息，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 的求值<strong>不依赖</strong>产品是否应税。把两者解耦，才能在客户免税资质过期时精确重算受影响的行项目集合，而非重算整张订单。三轴的失效模式差异巨大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>轴</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>变更节奏</th>\n<th>失效后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>税基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>这笔钱里哪部分进应税基数</td>\n<td>折扣归属、运费规则、捆绑拆分</td>\n<td>随订单逐笔</td>\n<td>少缴或多缴，金额级误差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品应税性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>taxable</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{1}[\\text{taxable}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">taxable</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>这类货物在该辖区是否征税</td>\n<td>税目编码 → Taxability Matrix</td>\n<td>立法/税率表，季度到年度</td>\n<td>系统性错算整类商品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资质匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>买方凭证是否覆盖本次交易</td>\n<td>证书 × 辖区 × 理由 × 时点</td>\n<td>随凭证生命周期</td>\n<td>举证责任落回卖方，追税加罚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>税基错误是金额误差，产品应税性错误是规则版本误差，资质匹配错误是<strong>法律风险</strong>误差——用一个布尔位承载这三种东西，等于把法律风险信号淹没在计算噪声里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"税基拆解-从毛额到应税基数\">税基拆解：从毛额到应税基数</h2><p>税基不是订单总额。它在各州法里叫 <strong>sales price</strong>，是一个<strong>规则化的构造</strong>而非字段直取。Streamlined Sales Tax 的 Library of Definitions 将其定义为卖方收到的对价总额，再逐项加减：<strong>由第三方补贴的折扣</strong>（制造商返利券、平台补贴）要计回税基，因为卖方实际收到了补偿；<strong>卖方自己承担</strong>的折扣（促销、优惠码）不计入，因为卖方真的少收了钱（<a href=\"https://www.streamlinedsalestax.org/for-businesses/state-taxability-matrix\">SSTGB Library of Definitions</a>）。同一张订单里两类券混用，因此必须逐券带一个 <code>reimbursed_by_third_party</code> 标志。</p>\n<p><strong>delivery charges</strong> 走另一条规则：SST 把运费/装卸费整体视为 sales price 的一部分，但是否随货物一并征税由各州在 Taxability Matrix 单独申报。多数州&quot;跟随主货物&quot;——货物应税则运费应税，货物用于转售而免税则运费一并免税。因此税基与产品应税性必须<strong>同源求值</strong>，否则会出现&quot;商品免了、运费还要税&quot;这类在会员州站不住脚的结果。</p>\n<p><strong>bundled transaction</strong>（捆绑交易）是唯一需要分摊的结构：两个或以上可区分的产品以<strong>一个不可单独计价的单价</strong>出售，典型如&quot;买打印机送墨盒&quot;。SST 的 de minimis 规则给出路：若应税成分价格<strong>不超过总价（或卖方成本）的 10%</strong>，整个交易按非捆绑处理。拆解器因此必须计算<strong>应税占比</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>应税成分价格</mtext><mtext>总价</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\frac{\\text{应税成分价格}}{\\text{总价}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总价</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">应税成分价格</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>免税基数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>D</mi></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>应税占比</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>否则按可拆分比例</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{免税基数} = \\begin{cases} D &amp; \\text{应税占比} \\le 10\\% \\\\ D \\times (1 - \\rho) &amp; \\text{否则按可拆分比例} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">免税基数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应税占比</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">否则按可拆分比例</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>税基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 因此必须作为<strong>独立可审计的中间量</strong>落库，而非在税额算完后反推。</p>\n<h2 id=\"产品应税性判定-从税目编码到-taxability-matrix\">产品应税性判定：从税目编码到 Taxability Matrix</h2><p>产品应税性在引擎里是一条<strong>编码映射链路</strong>：商品类目 → 内部产品税目编码（product tax code，如 Avalara 与 Vertex 体系里的 <code>PC</code> / <code>TC</code> 码）→ 目的地辖区的 Taxability Matrix 单元格 → 该税目在本辖区的应税性。Avalara AvaTax 与 Vertex 的计税服务都以这套&quot;税目 × 辖区&quot;二维矩阵作为免税判定的前置输入（<a href=\"https://developer.avalara.com/avatax/dev-guide/\">Avalara Developer</a>、<a href=\"https://www.vertexinc.com/\">Vertex</a>）。与税基的差别在于：税基是<strong>每笔订单独有</strong>的，应税性是<strong>税目与辖区共有</strong>的。</p>\n<p>矩阵的粒度决定了系统天花板。SST 的 Taxability Matrix 覆盖几十个产品定义与各会员州的对应处理，并<strong>要求各州按季度更新</strong>。它同时暴露了三类击穿免税判定的分歧：服装（宾州、明尼苏达等免税或季节性免税，多数州应税——在免税州&quot;免税&quot;判定根本不成立，本就无税）；数字商品（部分州按有形动产 TPP 处理、部分州单独立法，证书上&quot;转售有形动产&quot;的理由在该州可能不覆盖数字商品）；SaaS（纽约明确应税、部分州界定为服务，用途型免税理由须与本州定性一致）。</p>\n<p>矩阵的<strong>版本</strong>与<strong>时点</strong>是审计关键。多数州的应税性变更在<strong>生效日</strong>而非发布日适用，引擎必须按<strong>交易发生日</strong>（tax point）取历史版本矩阵，而非&quot;当前最新&quot;。2026 年欧盟侧对应物是 ViDA 推动的数字报告义务，它把应税性判定的时点从&quot;申报期&quot;推向&quot;实时交易&quot;——同一类压力：判定必须可回放到具体日期。此外，<strong>产品应税性的求值不消耗任何买方信息</strong>，因此它可被大幅缓存（按 <code>税目 × 辖区 × 生效日</code>），而资质匹配不能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资质匹配-证书-辖区-理由的三维交集\">资质匹配：证书×辖区×理由的三维交集</h2><p>资质匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个四元谓词：<strong>证书类型在辖区 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 是否被接受</strong>、<strong>证书上是否填写了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的注册号</strong>、<strong>免税理由是否覆盖本次交易</strong>、<strong>证书在交易时点是否有效</strong>。四者全真才 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。它与产品应税性彻底解耦，但输入依赖本 hub 前面章节的两个模型：证书的辖区覆盖规则来自<a href=\"../resale-certificate-capture-validation/resale-certificate-type-jurisdiction-model\">转售证书类型与各辖区差异模型</a>，免税理由是否允许则来自<a href=\"../exemption-entity-tax-id-model/exemption-entity-type-reason-model\">免税实体类型与免税理由分类模型</a>。三条工程约束决定其形态。</p>\n<p>其一，MTC 无法保证任何州接受其统一表，且各州可在不通知的情况下改变政策（<a href=\"https://www.mtc.gov/resources/faq-uniform-sales-and-use-tax-certificate/\">MTC FAQ</a>）。因此&quot;这张表在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 是否被接受&quot;必须是一张<strong>带生效日期的辖区能力表</strong>，而非枚举常量。</p>\n<p>其二，证书有效期是半开区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_{start}, t_{end})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，判定必须用交易时点求值：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t \\in [t_{start}, t_{end})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。blanket 与 single-use 证书只是区间取值的两个极端，见<a href=\"../exemption-entity-tax-id-model/exemption-scope-effectiveness-model\">免税覆盖范围与生效时点模型</a>。</p>\n<p>其三，<strong>举证责任不对称</strong>。Streamlined 体系明确表示：除佐治亚外，卖方<strong>无需核实</strong>买方提供的 ID 号是否有效，也无需判断买方是否有注册义务（<a href=\"https://www.streamlinedsalestax.org/for-businesses/exemptions\">Streamlined Sales Tax</a>）。这划定了<strong>校验深度上限</strong>：会员州只要求号非空，多做实时核验不增加法律保护。相反，加州要求卖方在<strong>善意接受</strong>完整证书后保留至少四年，且买方明知非转售而出证要承担税款之外、<strong>$500 或涉税金额 10% 中的较高者</strong>的罚金（<a href=\"https://www.cdtfa.ca.gov/formspubs/cdtfa230.pdf\">CDTFA-230</a>）。加州的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 因此必须额外记录&quot;取得时点&quot;与&quot;完整性断言&quot;，否则四年后的审计无法证明善意。</p>\n<p>四类机制的差异可直接压成一张匹配矩阵。其中 <strong>direct pay permit（直接付税许可）</strong> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 的特殊取值：买方获批自行申报，卖方不代收——税基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 仍需完整计算并上报，仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{line}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 置零并打标记。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>匹配维度</th>\n<th>时点要求</th>\n<th>引擎处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美国转售证书</td>\n<td>证书 × 辖区 × 理由</td>\n<td>交易时点有效</td>\n<td>走 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 谓词，落证书快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国 direct pay permit</td>\n<td>买方自行申报</td>\n<td>许可有效期</td>\n<td>长期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，税基仍算、税额置零并标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EU 反向征收</td>\n<td>有效 VAT 号（VIES）</td>\n<td>交易时点有效</td>\n<td>用 VIES 校验号有效性，非证书</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EU/UK 零税率出口</td>\n<td>货物离境凭证</td>\n<td>离境时点</td>\n<td>类似 use-based，依赖单据链</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"判定流水线与可复现审计追踪\">判定流水线与可复现审计追踪</h2><p>三轴的求值顺序不是任意的：先解析税基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>（纯交易结构）→ 再求产品应税性（依赖辖区规则版本）→ 最后求资质匹配（依赖凭证与买方）。这个顺序让<strong>每一层都能在上一层为假时短路</strong>：产品本就不应税，无需触碰任何凭证；凭证未提供，仍要算出&quot;若应税则税额为多少&quot;以便补证后一键重算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[订单行项目] --&gt; B[解析税基 D&lt;br/&gt;折扣/运费/捆绑拆分]&#10;    B --&gt; C[按 tax point 取&lt;br/&gt;辖区规则版本]&#10;    C --&gt; D{taxable p,j}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[税额 0: 非应税品]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[查买方凭证&lt;br/&gt;cert x j x reason x t]&#10;    F --&gt; G{证书存在且时点有效?}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| H[按应税计算, 标记待补证]&#10;    G --&gt;|是| I{理由覆盖本次交易?}&#10;    I --&gt;|否| H&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[税额 0: 资质匹配]&#10;    E --&gt; K[写判定记录]&#10;    H --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K&#10;    K --&gt; L[快照: 规则版本+证书版本+D]\">flowchart TD\n    A[订单行项目] --&gt; B[解析税基 D&lt;br/&gt;折扣/运费/捆绑拆分]\n    B --&gt; C[按 tax point 取&lt;br/&gt;辖区规则版本]\n    C --&gt; D{taxable p,j}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[税额 0: 非应税品]\n    D --&gt;|是| F[查买方凭证&lt;br/&gt;cert x j x reason x t]\n    F --&gt; G{证书存在且时点有效?}\n    G --&gt;|否| H[按应税计算, 标记待补证]\n    G --&gt;|是| I{理由覆盖本次交易?}\n    I --&gt;|否| H\n    I --&gt;|是| J[税额 0: 资质匹配]\n    E --&gt; K[写判定记录]\n    H --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K\n    K --&gt; L[快照: 规则版本+证书版本+D]</pre><p>判定记录必须自带<strong>最小可复现输入快照</strong>：税基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 及构成明细、产品税目与所用矩阵版本号、证书 ID 与所引用的证书版本、交易时点、以及走到哪一条短路分支。缺少任一项，审计时都无法回答&quot;当时为什么这么算&quot;。这与<a href=\"../exemption-entity-tax-id-model/tax-registration-id-validation-model\">税务登记号校验模型</a>共享同一原则：能重放的<strong>输入</strong>才有辩护力。</p>\n<p>最后一条纪律是<strong>重算</strong>。资质匹配是唯一会在时间轴上&quot;事后翻转&quot;的轴——证书今天有效，明天过期，后天被撤销。撤销或过期<strong>不应</strong>回溯改写历史交易（多数州按交易时点判定），但必须触发<strong>前向重算任务</strong>：把该买方自失效时点起的未申报交易重新标记为应税并生成补缴。这要求证书版本在判定记录里可寻址——存的不是&quot;有效/无效&quot;，而是&quot;证书 V 版本在时点 t 的判定结果&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>免税判定是<strong>三轴合取</strong>：税基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>、产品应税性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>taxable</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{1}[\\text{taxable}(p,j)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">taxable</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span>、资质匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q(cert,j,reason,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cer</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。压成布尔位会损失法律风险信号。</li>\n<li>三轴数据主权不同：税基随订单逐笔、产品应税性随辖区规则版本、资质匹配随凭证生命周期变化——必须分开缓存与版本化。</li>\n<li>税基不是订单总额：第三方补贴折扣要计回、卖方折扣不计；运费跟随主货物应税性；捆绑交易用 10% de minimis 规则简化。</li>\n<li>产品应税性是&quot;税目 × 辖区 × 生效日&quot;的矩阵查询，须按时点取历史版本，且可被大幅缓存。</li>\n<li>资质匹配是四元谓词；校验深度按辖区差异设定：会员州只要求号非空，加州要留存四年与善意断言。</li>\n<li>判定记录必须落最小可复现输入快照；证书失效只触发<strong>前向</strong>重算，不回溯改写历史。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"计税引擎免税判定模型（税基×产品应税性×资质匹配）","id":"计税引擎免税判定模型-税基-产品应税性-资质匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三轴合取与各自的数据主权","id":"核心概念-三轴合取与各自的数据主权"},{"level":2,"text":"税基拆解：从毛额到应税基数","id":"税基拆解-从毛额到应税基数"},{"level":2,"text":"产品应税性判定：从税目编码到 Taxability Matrix","id":"产品应税性判定-从税目编码到-taxability-matrix"},{"level":2,"text":"资质匹配：证书×辖区×理由的三维交集","id":"资质匹配-证书-辖区-理由的三维交集"},{"level":2,"text":"判定流水线与可复现审计追踪","id":"判定流水线与可复现审计追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"证书有效性校验规则、驳回与例外处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sales-tax-exemption-resale-certificate-management/resale-certificate-capture-validation/certificate-validation-rejection-exception"},"next":{"title":"免税证书查找与判定规则执行顺序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sales-tax-exemption-resale-certificate-management/tax-engine-exemption-determination/exemption-lookup-rule-evaluation-order"}}